| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `output/_template/type3_prompts.json` | Copy per article |
| `output/Week1_Rank{N}_{Topic}_type3_prompts.json` | Article prompts manifest |
| `scripts/patch_{occasion}_type3_clean.py` | Upload + patch WP post |
